    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "nl_consider",
      "label": "Good to know cards",
      "default": "<ol><li><strong>Chain weight changes the fit</strong>Thicker and beaded chains take up more room, so they sit higher than a fine chain of the same length.</li><li><strong>Pendants hang lower</strong>We measure the chain only, so the pendant itself will rest a little below the length you choose.</li><li><strong>Two lengths means adjustable</strong>A necklace listed as 16\"–18\" has a built-in extender, so it can be worn at either length.</li><li><strong>Layering?</strong>Space each chain about 2\" apart so every layer stays visible and they tangle less.</li></ol>",
      "info": "Each list item becomes a card. Bold text at the start of an item becomes the card's title."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "nl_measure_title",
      "label": "Measuring heading",
      "default": "Measure at home"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "nl_measure_text",
      "label": "Measuring text",
      "default": "<p>Grab a necklace you already love and measure it. Then decide whether you want your new one shorter, longer or the same.</p><p>No necklace to hand? A length of string works just as well.</p>"
    },
