      "id": "nl_steps",
      "label": "Measuring steps",
      "default": "<ol><li>Drape your necklace or string around your neck until it sits where you like it.</li><li>Unclasp it or mark the string, then lay it out straight. Include the clasp in the length.</li><li>Measure it against a ruler and pick the closest size.</li></ol>",
      "info": "Each list item becomes a step."
