    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "br_choose",
      "label": "How to choose cards",
      "default": "<ol><li><strong>Start with your wrist</strong>Measure where the bracelet will actually sit, just above the wrist bone.</li><li><strong>Decide on the feel</strong>Close to the skin, or loose with a little movement? It's personal, so go with what you like wearing.</li><li><strong>Allow for thickness</strong>Chunky and beaded styles feel smaller on the wrist, so go up about ½\".</li><li><strong>Plan your stack</strong>Mix lengths, for example 6.5\" and 7\", so each piece sits in its own place.</li></ol>",
      "info": "Each list item becomes a card. Bold text at the start of an item becomes the card's title."
    },
